## Current official date

Rockstar's current official release date for Grand Theft Auto VI is November 19, 2026.{{cite:taketwo-preorders}} Rockstar's Launch Trailer page displays the game as 'Coming November 19, 2026.'{{cite:gta6-launch-trailer-page}}

## Earlier Rockstar announcements

Rockstar previously announced a release date of May 26, 2026.{{cite:verge-delay-nov-2026}} Before the May 26, 2026 date, Rockstar had planned to release the game in 2025.{{cite:verge-delay-nov-2026}}

## Which announcement is current

The November 19, 2026 date is the current announcement replacing earlier 2025 and May 26, 2026 plans.{{cite:verge-delay-nov-2026}}

## Additional launch details

Rockstar and partners began public pre-loads and store pre-order activity in November 2026 ahead of the November 19 launch.{{cite:taketwo-preorders}}

