## Overview

Rockstar's platform support page was last updated November 4, 2026.{{cite:gta6-support-platforms}} Take-Two's pre-order announcement states "Grand Theft Auto VI will be available at the" Rockstar Games Store.{{cite:taketwo-preorders}} Take-Two's announcement states digital pre-load begins November 12, 2026 for pre-orders.{{cite:taketwo-preorders}} Take-Two's announcement states the game's launch date is November 19, 2026.{{cite:taketwo-preorders}}

## Physical and edition details

The physical Grand Theft Auto VI box will contain a download code rather than a disc.{{cite:gta6-support-platforms}} Physical copies are expected to be available for shipping and pickup starting November 12, 2026.{{cite:gta6-support-platforms}} Physical Standard Edition boxes include one code for the Vintage Vice City Pack and other items.{{cite:gta6-support-platforms}} A physical Ultimate Edition is not available, but "Standard Edition owners can purchase the Ultimate Edition Upgrade" digitally.{{cite:gta6-support-platforms}}

## PC status

GameSpot reports Rockstar has not officially said anything about a PC version yet.{{cite:gamespot-pc-status}} GameSpot reports the official platform information and Rockstar's website do not mention a PC version.{{cite:gamespot-pc-status}}

