## Overview

"The physical version of Grand Theft Auto VI" contains a download code for the digital game rather than a disc.{{cite:gta6-support-platforms}} A physical Ultimate Edition is not available; physical Standard Edition owners can buy the Ultimate Edition Upgrade after redeeming their code.{{cite:gta6-support-platforms}}

## Packaging and included content

Physical pre-orders include a single code for the game and the Vintage Vice City Pack contents.{{cite:gta6-support-platforms}} The Vintage Vice City Pack in physical pre-orders contains a "'55 Vapid Stanier sedan and garage, outfits and hairstyles", and an exclusive weapon pattern.{{cite:gta6-support-platforms}} Take-Two’s pre-order announcement states all "pre-orders and purchases before November 20, 2026" include the Vintage Vice City Pack.{{cite:taketwo-preorders}}

## Availability and pre-loading

The physical version "is expected to become available for shipping and" retailer pickup starting November 12, 2026.{{cite:gta6-support-platforms}} Codes received from physical copies can be used immediately to support pre-loading on November 10, 2026.{{cite:gta6-support-platforms}} Take-Two’s announcement also states the physical version "will be available starting November 12, 2026 to support pre-loading".{{cite:taketwo-preorders}}

## Region and redemption notes

Code redemption region restrictions are based on the region associated with a user’s platform account.{{cite:gta6-support-platforms}} Rockstar recommends purchasing from a retailer in the same country as the platform account to avoid potential activation problems.{{cite:gta6-support-platforms}}

