## Overview

Digital and physical versions of Grand Theft Auto VI are available.{{cite:gta6-support-platforms}}

## Official digital storefronts

Rockstar lists "the PlayStation Store, Microsoft Store, Rockstar Games Store, and global retailers" as places to buy Grand Theft Auto VI.{{cite:taketwo-preorders}} PlayStation Store offers both Standard and Ultimate Editions and lists prices of $79.99 and $99.99 respectively for digital pre-order.{{cite:playstation-store-ultimate}} Microsoft Store shows Grand Theft Auto VI available to pre-order and encourages pre-loading via its storefront.{{cite:xbox-cloud-gta6}}

## Physical versions and codes

Physical boxes contain a digital download code and do not include a disc.{{cite:gta6-support-platforms}} Physical versions are expected to ship and be available for pickup from retailers starting November 12, 2026.{{cite:gta6-support-platforms}} Physical pre-orders include one code for the game and the Vintage Vice City Pack.{{cite:gta6-support-platforms}}

## Region and redemption notes

Code redemptions are restricted by the region associated with the purchaser's platform account.{{cite:gta6-support-platforms}} Rockstar recommends buying from a retailer in the same country as the purchaser's platform account to avoid activation problems.{{cite:gta6-support-platforms}}

