## Overview

Rockstar introduces Lucia Caminos as a Vice City character whose father "taught her to fight as soon as she could walk."{{cite:gta6-people-lucia}} Official biography adds that "Life has been coming at her swinging ever since."{{cite:gta6-people-lucia}}

## Prison and release

Rockstar says "Fighting for her family landed her in the Leonida Penitentiary."{{cite:gta6-people-lucia}} The official account of her release is that "Sheer luck got her out."{{cite:gta6-people-lucia}} Rockstar then describes her as "Fresh out of prison and ready to change the odds in her favor."{{cite:gta6-people-lucia}}

## Ambition

Rockstar states that "More than anything, Lucia wants the good life her mom has dreamed of since their days in Liberty City."{{cite:gta6-people-lucia}} Official copy contrasts that wish with "half-baked fantasies" and says she "is prepared to take matters into her own hands."{{cite:gta6-people-lucia}} A line in the official biography reads, "The only thing that matters is who you know and what you got."{{cite:gta6-people-lucia}} Rockstar also writes that she has "learned her lesson — only smart moves from here."{{cite:gta6-people-lucia}}

## Connection to Jason Duval

Official materials say "A life with Jason could be her way out."{{cite:gta6-people-lucia}} Jason's page adds that "Meeting Lucia could be the best or worst thing to ever happen to him."{{cite:gta6-people-jason}}

