## Overview

Rockstar labels the video as Trailer 2 on the Grand Theft Auto VI official site.{{cite:gta6-official-site}} The official pre-load page lists Grand Theft Auto VI Trailer 2 with a runtime of 2:47 and a May 6, 2025 date.{{cite:gta6-pre-load-page}} The game's site groups Trailer 2 alongside other official videos such as Trailer 1 and the Launch Trailer.{{cite:gta6-official-site}}

## Story hook presented in Trailer 2

The official site states Jason and Lucia undertake an easy score that goes wrong.{{cite:gta6-official-site}} That failed easy score places them on the darkest side of Vice City, described as the sunniest place in America.{{cite:gta6-official-site}} The official description frames the protagonists as caught in "a criminal conspiracy stretching across the state of Leonida".{{cite:gta6-official-site}} The official site says Jason and Lucia must rely on each other more than ever to survive the conspiracy.{{cite:gta6-official-site}}

## Invitation to explore Vice City and Leonida

The official site uses the phrase Vice City, USA to spotlight the game's setting.{{cite:gta6-official-site}} Rockstar's media pages encourage exploration of Leonida with screenshots and a launch gallery.{{cite:gta6-official-site}}

