## PlayStation 5 features

PlayStation describes Tempest 3D Audio support on PlayStation 5 for the game. (PlayStation){{cite:playstation-gta6}} PlayStation lists fast loading as an enhanced PlayStation 5 experience. (PlayStation){{cite:playstation-gta6}} PlayStation Store states DualSense vibration and trigger effects are supported. (PlayStation){{cite:playstation-gta6}}

## Store features and play modes

PlayStation lists Remote Play support for Grand Theft Auto VI. (PlayStation){{cite:playstation-gta6}} PlayStation Store indicates offline play is enabled and the game supports one player. (PlayStation){{cite:playstation-gta6}} PlayStation digital pre-orders include a one‑month GTA+ subscription offer to claim by March 31, 2027. (PlayStation){{cite:playstation-store-ultimate}}

